        "title": "MCP architecture: Client-Server protocol",
        "description": "MCP uses JSON-RPC. Standard transports are stdio and Streamable HTTP; the historical SSE transport remains supported by Claude Code but is deprecated. Streamable HTTP can itself stream replies using SSE. The diagram illustrates a tool-call exchange, not every MCP capability.",
